sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant CMP_KTL_003 as Controller
  participant CMP_KTL_002 as Temperature sensor
  User->>CMP_KTL_003: element_temp_c
  CMP_KTL_002->>CMP_KTL_003: INT-KTL-005 Element temperature
